MIGRANTS STOPPED, MANY OF THEM

00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:26.303
CHILDREN.

00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:28.744
AND I CAN’T HELP BUT THINK IT’S

00:00:28.755 --> 00:00:30.606
INTERESTING THAT IT COINCIDED ON

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.993
THE SAME DAY THAT YOUR

00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:34.471
