00:00:34.472 --> 00:00:36.556
AND SECRETARY BLINK WERE IN

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:38.786
MEXICO TALKING ABOUT --

00:00:38.787 --> 00:00:40.911
SECRETARY BLINKEN WERE IN MEXICO

00:00:40.922 --> 00:00:41.967
TALKING ABOUT BORDER SECURITY

00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:42.276
ISSUES.

00:00:42.287 --> 00:00:43.849
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF IT?

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:45.780
&gt;&gt; THE ISSUE WE SAW WITH

00:00:45.814 --> 00:00:47.522
HUNDREDS OF MIGRANTS IN THOSE

00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:48.760
TRACTOR-TRAILER TRUCKS IS,

00:00:48.794 --> 00:00:50.873
AGAIN, ANOTHER SYMPTOM OF THIS

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.209
VERY INHUMANE IMMIGRATION AND

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.582
BORDER POLICY THAT THE BIDEN

00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:54.578
ADMINISTRATION HAS.

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:56.883
AGAIN, THEY DON’T WANT TO TALK

00:00:56.894 --> 00:00:59.060
CONCERN YOU DON’T SEE OFFICIALS

00:00:59.094 --> 00:01:00.721
OR THE SECRETARY OR ANY OTHER

00:01:00.722 --> 00:01:01.625
ADMINISTRATION OFFICIAL TALKING

00:01:01.626 --> 00:01:03.111
ABOUT THAT TYPE OF SEIZURE AND

00:01:03.112 --> 00:01:04.636
THE PAIN AND THE DANGEROUS

00:01:04.637 --> 00:01:05.788
JOURNEY THAT THOSE MIGRANTS ARE

00:01:05.789 --> 00:01:06.803
BEING PUT THROUGH.

00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:08.161
BUT THEY’RE DOING THAT BECAUSE

00:01:08.195 --> 00:01:09.478
THEY KNOW THAT THE U.S. BORDER

00:01:09.489 --> 00:01:10.286
IS OPEN.

00:01:10.297 --> 00:01:11.939
AND SO THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.628
IS SENDING THEM THE SIGNAL TO

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:14.988
TAKE THAT DANGEROUS JOURNEY, AND

00:01:14.999 --> 00:01:16.421
I THINK THAT’S WRONG.

00:01:16.423 --> 00:01:18.006
IT CERTAINLY NEEDS TO CHANGE.

00:01:18.017 --> 00:01:19.760
LOOK, WHETHER YOU HAVE THE

00:01:19.771 --> 00:01:21.126
SECRETARY OF STATE, THE DHS

00:01:21.137 --> 00:01:22.355
SECRETARY AND THE ATTORNEY

00:01:22.389 --> 00:01:23.876
GENERAL DOWN THERE IN MEXICO

00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:24.963
TALKING ABOUT HOPEFULLY SECURITY

00:01:24.974 --> 00:01:26.183
AND BORDER SECURITY, BUT I

00:01:26.217 --> 00:01:27.689
NOTICE THAT THEY’RE ALSO TALKING

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.906
ABOUT A WHOLE HOST OF OTHER

00:01:29.939 --> 00:01:31.524
ISSUES, THESE ARE TALKS THAT

00:01:31.526 --> 00:01:32.942
HAPPEN IN ANY ADMINISTRATION

00:01:32.943 --> 00:01:34.465
THAT HAPPEN ALL THE TIME.

00:01:34.476 --> 00:01:35.957
THE QUESTION THOUGH IS WHAT IS

00:01:35.991 --> 00:01:37.786
CHANGING ON THAT BORDER AS A

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.830
RESULT OF THOSE TALKS.

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.280
WHAT IS CHANGING ON THE

00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:42.820
ENFORCEMENT POSTURE BOTH IN THE

00:01:42.854 --> 00:01:44.034
U.S. AND ON THE MEXICO SIDE.

00:01:44.045 --> 00:01:45.498
AND I DON’T THINK THAT WE’RE

00:01:45.509 --> 00:01:46.899
SEEING ANY DIFFERENCES.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.638
WE’RE CERTAINLY NOT SEEING ANY

00:01:48.649 --> 00:01:50.275
CONCRETE ACTIONS THAT THEY’RE

00:01:50.286 --> 00:01:51.788
TAKING AS A RESULT OF THOSE

00:01:51.822 --> 00:01:52.538
TALKS.

00:01:52.539 --> 00:01:55.421
GRIFF: WELL, THAT’S WHY I WAS SO

00:01:55.422 --> 00:01:57.054
EXCITED TO SPEAK WITH YOU

00:01:57.065 --> 00:01:58.880
BECAUSE WHAT SPECIFICALLY IF YOU

00:01:58.891 --> 00:02:00.642
WERE IN SECRETARY MAYORKAS’

00:02:00.676 --> 00:02:02.624
CHAIR IN MEXICO, WHAT WOULD YOU

00:02:02.635 --> 00:02:04.616
ASK MEXICO FOR?

00:02:04.649 --> 00:02:07.812
I JUST GOT BACK FROM THE MEXICAN

00:02:07.823 --> 00:02:09.095
SOUTHERN BORDER AND PORTRAYED

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.351
HOW OPEN THAT IS.

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:11.651
IT IS ABSOLUTELY BEING FLOODED,

00:02:11.662 --> 00:02:14.512
AND I’M GOING TO GET ON A PLANE

00:02:14.545 --> 00:02:16.342
IN A FEW HOURS AND GO TO PANAMA

00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:18.362
WHERE THERE ARE TENSES OF

00:02:18.363 --> 00:02:20.173
THOUSANDS OF HAITIANS -- TENS OF

00:02:20.184 --> 00:02:21.483
THOUSANDS OF HAITIANS ON THEIR

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:22.224
WAY NOW.

00:02:22.235 --> 00:02:23.862
SO TO BE CONSTRUCTIVE, WHAT CAN

00:02:23.873 --> 00:02:24.959
MEXICO DO?

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:26.755
WHAT SHOULD THE U.S. BE ASKING

00:02:26.766 --> 00:02:27.285
FOR?

00:02:27.319 --> 00:02:29.266
&gt;&gt; WELL, THE MEXICAN GOVERNMENT

00:02:29.277 --> 00:02:30.639
CAN DO A VARIETY OF DIFFERENT

00:02:30.672 --> 00:02:31.047
THINGS.

00:02:31.058 --> 00:02:33.869
THEY CAN CLOSE THEIR SOUTHERN

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.640
BORDER DOWN TO THAT ILLEGAL

00:02:35.651 --> 00:02:36.968
MIGRATION THAT WE SEE.

00:02:37.002 --> 00:02:38.418
IT’S NOT EASY FOR THEM.

00:02:38.419 --> 00:02:39.493
THEY DON’T HAVE THE SAME

00:02:39.504 --> 00:02:40.782
RESOURCES AND INFRASTRUCTURE

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:42.498
THAT THE U.S. HAS, BUT IT IS

00:02:42.509 --> 00:02:42.888
DOABLE.

00:02:42.899 --> 00:02:44.810
THEY CAN DEPLOY THEIR GIVE LENT

00:02:44.845 --> 00:02:46.702
OF THE NATIONAL GUARD TO STOP

00:02:46.713 --> 00:02:47.896
INDIVIDUALS COMING ACROSS THE

00:02:47.897 --> 00:02:49.466
SOUTHERN BORDER THAT DON’T HAVE

00:02:49.468 --> 00:02:50.379
THE CORRECT PAPERWORK.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:51.678
THEY CAN SHUT THAT DOWN.

00:02:51.689 --> 00:02:53.329
THEY HAVE A NUMBER OF OTHER

00:02:53.362 --> 00:02:54.487
BORDER CHECKPOINTS WITHIN THE

00:02:54.488 --> 00:02:55.664
INTERIOR OF MEXICO.

00:02:55.665 --> 00:02:57.164
THEY NEED TO BE PROPERLY

00:02:57.175 --> 00:02:58.226
STAFFED, BUT YOU NEED TO ENFORCE

00:02:58.259 --> 00:02:58.654
IT.

00:02:58.665 --> 00:03:00.936
TIME AND TIME AGAIN WE’VE SEEN

00:03:00.971 --> 00:03:02.432
AND HEARD OF REPORTS WHERE

00:03:02.433 --> 00:03:04.258
MIGRANTS COME THROUGH THESE

00:03:04.269 --> 00:03:05.573
BORDER CHECKPOINTS OR OTHER

00:03:05.607 --> 00:03:07.385
CHECKPOINTS, THEY DON’T HAVE THE

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:09.107
RIGHT PAPERWORK, AND YET THEY

00:03:09.141 --> 00:03:11.008
CONTINUE ON THEIR JOURNEY.

00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:12.926
THEY NEED TO START FLYING OR

00:03:12.927 --> 00:03:14.299
REPATRIATING FOLKS FROM MEXICO

00:03:14.301 --> 00:03:15.983
BACK TO CENTRAL AMERICA, BACK TO

00:03:15.994 --> 00:03:17.288
SOUTH AMERICA, BACK TO HAITI

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.823
THE, BACK TO ALL THE COUNTRIES

00:03:18.857 --> 00:03:20.196
THAT THEY’RE PICKING UP.

00:03:20.197 --> 00:03:22.403
THEY NOT ONLY NEED TO STOP THEM,

00:03:22.414 --> 00:03:23.624
APPREHEND THEM AND DETAIN THEM

00:03:23.625 --> 00:03:25.502
IF THEY HAVE NO LEGAL RIGHT TO

00:03:25.536 --> 00:03:27.327
BE IN MEXICO, BUT THEY NEED TO

00:03:27.338 --> 00:03:29.869
REMOVE THEM BACK TO THEIR HOME

00:03:29.903 --> 00:03:31.222
COUNTRIES INSTEAD OF SIMPLY

00:03:31.223 --> 00:03:33.173
RELEASING THEM FOR THEM TO

00:03:33.174 --> 00:03:34.445
CONTINUE ON TO THE SOUTHERN

00:03:34.456 --> 00:03:34.944
BORDER.

00:03:34.955 --> 00:03:37.644
GRIFF: I WANT TO GET YOUR

00:03:37.655 --> 00:03:39.533
REACTION, BILL MELUGIN ALLUDED

00:03:39.544 --> 00:03:41.597
TO IT, I RETWEETED VICE

00:03:41.631 --> 00:03:43.357
PRESIDENT HARRIS’ VIDEO SHE PUT

00:03:43.358 --> 00:03:46.276
OUT OF VISITING A DAY SCHOOL,

00:03:46.287 --> 00:03:48.030
VISITING WITH THESE SCHOOL

00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:49.143
CHILDREN LITERALLY, CHAD,

00:03:49.154 --> 00:03:51.507
PLAYING BINGO WITH THEM ON THE

00:03:51.518 --> 00:03:53.320
DAY THAT BLINKEN, MAYORKAS AND

00:03:53.331 --> 00:03:54.935
MERRICK GARLAND ARE DOWN IN

00:03:54.969 --> 00:03:56.659
MEXICO TRYING TO SOLVE THE

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:56.954
CRISIS.

00:03:56.988 --> 00:03:58.394
YOUR REACTION.

00:03:58.405 --> 00:04:00.531
&gt;&gt; WELL, AGAIN, IT’S QUITE

00:04:00.542 --> 00:04:03.084
UNBELIEVABLE THAT YOU HAVE THE

00:04:03.095 --> 00:04:05.457
BORDER CZAR WHO IS IN CHARGE OF

00:04:05.468 --> 00:04:06.884
SHE SAYS NOT BORDER SECURITY,

00:04:06.895 --> 00:04:08.666
BUT SHE’S TALKING ABOUT THE ROOT

00:04:08.677 --> 00:04:10.069
CAUSES OF MIGRATION, THAT’S WHAT

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.898
THIS TEAM WAS DOING IN MEXICO,

00:04:11.909 --> 00:04:13.219
TALKING ABOUT SOME OF THOSE ROOT

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.700
CAUSES, MEETING WITH THE

00:04:14.711 --> 00:04:15.958
PRESIDENT OF MEXICO.

00:04:15.969 --> 00:04:17.869
SO IT’S CERTAINLY AT THE VICE

00:04:17.903 --> 00:04:19.898
PRESIDENT’S LEVEL TO BE DOWN

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:21.658
THERE TO BE ENGAGED ON THESE

00:04:21.659 --> 00:04:22.628
DISCUSSIONS, AND SHE’S

00:04:22.639 --> 00:04:23.451
COMPLETELY ABSENT.

00:04:23.485 --> 00:04:25.286
SHE’S ABSENT FROM ANY FOLLOW-UP

00:04:25.297 --> 00:04:27.208
TO HER PREVIOUS VISIT TO

00:04:27.219 --> 00:04:28.880
GUATEMALA AND THEN TO MEXICO BUT

00:04:28.913 --> 00:04:30.409
ALSO FROM THE SOUTHERN BORDER.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.246
SHE’S BEEN TO EL PASO WHICH HAS

00:04:32.257 --> 00:04:33.675
NOT SEEN THE VAST MAJORITY OF

00:04:33.686 --> 00:04:34.663
THE ILLEGAL CROSSINGS.

00:04:34.697 --> 00:04:36.217
YOU KNOW, WE NEED LEADERSHIP,

00:04:36.228 --> 00:04:37.519
AND WE NEED LEADERSHIP FROM THE

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:38.675
WHITE HOUSE WHICH IS LACK ARING

00:04:38.676 --> 00:04:39.604
AND FROM THE DEPARTMENT WHICH IS

00:04:39.639 --> 00:04:40.014
LACKING.

00:04:40.025 --> 00:04:42.332
AND I THINK THAT’S WHY YOU

00:04:42.366 --> 00:04:44.098
CONTINUE TO SEE THE SAME FAILED

00:04:44.099 --> 00:04:45.348
BORDER POLICIES MONTH IN AND

00:04:45.359 --> 00:04:46.562
MONTH OUT WHICH IS DELIVERING

00:04:46.596 --> 00:04:47.884
THE SAME RESULTS.

00:04:47.885 --> 00:04:50.414
GRIFF GREFE YOU TALK ABOUT

00:04:50.416 --> 00:04:51.993
LEADERSHIP, MR. SECRETARY, HOW

00:04:52.004 --> 00:04:55.290
CAN THEY GET THIS URN CONTROL,

00:04:55.324 --> 00:04:57.698
AND TELL ME HOW THIS ENDS.

00:04:57.709 --> 00:04:59.153
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK THERE’S VERY

00:04:59.164 --> 00:04:59.956
SPECIFIC THINGS THAT THEY CAN

00:04:59.991 --> 00:05:00.353
DO.

00:05:00.364 --> 00:05:03.259
AGAIN, WE LEFT THEM AD ROAD MAP

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.827
ON INITIATIVES AND POLICIES THAT

00:05:05.838 --> 00:05:08.137
WORK WHETHER IT’S THE REMAIN IN

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.107
MEXICO AGREEMENT, UNFORTUNATELY

00:05:09.109 --> 00:05:12.549
JUST LAST NIGHT WHICH WE HEARD,

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:14.186
YOU KNOW, CANCELING BORDER WALL

00:05:14.187 --> 00:05:14.836
CONTRACTS.

00:05:14.847 --> 00:05:17.618
IN THE RGV, IN THE RIO GRANDE

00:05:17.629 --> 00:05:19.295
VALLEY THERE IN TEXAS, WHICH IS

00:05:19.296 --> 00:05:21.139
GROUND ZERO FOR THE VAST

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.194
MAJORITY OF THESE ILLEGAL

00:05:22.228 --> 00:05:22.892
APPREHENSIONS.

00:05:22.903 --> 00:05:25.958
SO IN THE MIDST OF A 21-YEAR

00:05:25.969 --> 00:05:27.699
CRISIS, THEY DECIDE TO CANCEL

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:28.730
BORDER WALL CONTRACTS.

00:05:28.741 --> 00:05:30.153
THEY DECIDE TO CHANGE I.C.E.

00:05:30.154 --> 00:05:32.430
GUIDELINES AS THEY DID LAST WEEK

00:05:32.465 --> 00:05:34.130
WHERE YOU’RE NOT ABLE TO REMOVE

00:05:34.141 --> 00:05:35.493
INDIVIDUALS FROM THE INTERIOR OF

00:05:35.526 --> 00:05:37.103
THE COUNTRY IF THEY GET PAST THE

00:05:37.114 --> 00:05:37.978
BORDER PATROL.

00:05:38.011 --> 00:05:39.743
SO, AGAIN, THE BIDEN

00:05:39.744 --> 00:05:42.012
ADMINISTRATION IS CARRYING OUT

00:05:42.023 --> 00:05:43.439
AN AGENDA THAT IS NOT

00:05:43.473 --> 00:05:44.623
PRO-ENFORCEMENT, THAT IS NOT THE

00:05:44.634 --> 00:05:45.773
RULE OF LAW.

00:05:45.784 --> 00:05:47.250
THEY CONTINUE TO IMPLEMENT

00:05:47.284 --> 00:05:48.762
INITIATIVES THAT CONTINUE TO

00:05:48.763 --> 00:05:50.245
ALLOW AND ATTRACT INDIVIDUALS TO

00:05:50.256 --> 00:05:51.028
THE BORDER.

00:05:51.062 --> 00:05:52.789
GRIFF: IT SURE DOESN’T SEEM LIKE

